// Ch15 side errand (optional; requires ch15_reached_hollowmere). The current-singer (ch15_bark_current_singer) teaches
// Asha one phrase of Hollowmere's current-song. A Cantor learning a song the Order doesn't own. It is Hollowmere's,
// never Dace's (the Ch15 rule). Sets ch15_learned_current_phrase.
title: ch15_side_the_current_phrase
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
Townsfolk as "Current-singer" [neutral]: You're the Cantor. You sing for a living, then. Try this one. It's for the water off the bow. #line:ch15_phrase_001 #long
Asha [neutral]: There are no words. #line:ch15_phrase_002
Townsfolk as "Current-singer" [neutral]: The water doesn't know words. It knows low and high. Low in the middle. Like that. #line:ch15_phrase_003
Asha [soft_smile]: Like that? #line:ch15_phrase_004
Townsfolk as "Current-singer" [smile]: The hull knows it. Feel her settle? You'd make a Saltwright, Cantor. #line:ch15_phrase_005
<<set $ch15_learned_current_phrase = true>>
===
